  "answer": "D",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "Energy of one photon:\n$$E = \\frac{hc}{\\lambda} = \\frac{6.6 \\times 10^{-34} \\times 3 \\times 10^8}{600 \\times 10^{-9}} = 3.3 \\times 10^{-19}\\ \\text{J}$$\n\n$$N = \\frac{P}{E} = \\frac{3.3 \\times 10^{-3}}{3.3 \\times 10^{-19}} = 10^{16}\\ \\text{per second}$$",
